# oracle: kspace_style msm in a triclinic box (lamda coordinates: the grid scaled by the skew, the direct-sum limits from tribbox, the positions through x2lamda and lamda2x), pressure/scalar no with the tensor, cutoff/adjust no (the grid doubled to meet the accuracy 1e-2, then scaled by the skew: 8 8 8), order 4, pair lj/cut/coul/msm 7.0 8.0, rocksalt ions in a tilted cell, NVE, 40 steps.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 8.8e-14, atoms 4.7e-13.
units           metal
atom_style      charge
lattice         fcc 5.64
region          box prism 0 3 0 3 0 3 0.4 -0.3 0.25
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
lattice         fcc 5.64 origin 0.5 0.0 0.0
create_atoms    2 box
mass            1 22.99
mass            2 35.45
set             type 1 charge 1.0
set             type 2 charge -1.0
variable        dx atom 0.12*sin(0.53*x+0.21*y)
variable        dy atom 0.12*cos(0.37*y-0.19*z)
variable        dz atom 0.12*sin(0.29*z+0.41*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
variable        vx atom 2.0*sin(0.7*x+0.3*z)
variable        vy atom 2.0*cos(0.5*y+0.2*x)
variable        vz atom 2.0*sin(0.4*z-0.6*y)
velocity        all set v_vx v_vy v_vz units box
velocity        all zero linear
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/msm 7.0 8.0
pair_coeff      1 1 0.0100 2.35
pair_coeff      2 2 0.0050 4.40
pair_coeff      1 2 0.0070 3.00
kspace_style    msm 1.0e-2
kspace_modify   pressure/scalar no cutoff/adjust no order 4
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe evdwl ecoul elong etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             40
